{
  "name": "01 - Research Topic Registration",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 01 \u00b7 Research Topic Registration (API)\n`POST /webhook/research/topic`\n```json\n{\"researcher\":\"\u2026\",\"email\":\"\u2026\",\"topic\":\"\u2026\",\n \"keywords\":\"a, b\" | [\"a\",\"b\"],\"frequency\":\"daily|weekly|monthly\"}\n```\n**Responses**: 200 registered (`topic_id`) \u00b7 400 validation errors \u00b7 409 duplicate.\nDuplicate key = `email | lower(topic)` \u2192 idempotent.\nWrites `research_topics` (active=true) \u2192 picked up by **02**.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 560
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        100,
        -560
      ],
      "id": "61942704-0920-47db-80ce-5c65be769f26",
      "name": "Note 79a94f"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "research/topic",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        208,
        0
      ],
      "id": "0f221b61-b558-475c-ba92-6f1ae65a6c8d",
      "name": "Webhook",
      "webhookId": "f19782c7-6861-4627-9124-1e0dc818eacb"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const data = { ...($json.body || $json) };\n\nif (typeof data.keywords === 'string') {\n  data.keywords = data.keywords\n    .split(',')\n    .map(k => k.trim())\n    .filter(Boolean);\n}\n\nconst errors = [];\n\n// Validate researcher\nif (\n  !data.researcher ||\n  typeof data.researcher !== 'string' ||\n  data.researcher.trim() === ''\n) {\n  errors.push('researcher is required');\n}\n\n// Validate email\nif (\n  !data.email ||\n  typeof data.email !== 'string' ||\n  !/^[^\\s@]+@[^\\s@]+\\.[^\\s@]+$/.test(data.email.trim())\n) {\n  errors.push('valid email is required');\n}\n\n// Validate topic\nif (\n  !data.topic ||\n  typeof data.topic !== 'string' ||\n  data.topic.trim().length < 3\n) {\n  errors.push('topic is required (min 3 characters)');\n}\n\n// Validate keywords\nif (\n  !Array.isArray(data.keywords) ||\n  data.keywords.length === 0\n) {\n  errors.push('keywords must contain at least one item');\n}\n\n// Validate frequency\nconst frequency = String(data.frequency || 'weekly').toLowerCase();\n\nif (!['daily', 'weekly', 'monthly'].includes(frequency)) {\n  errors.push('frequency must be daily, weekly, or monthly');\n}\n\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    ...data,\n    frequency,\n    valid: errors.length === 0,\n    errors\n  }\n};",
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        448,
        0
      ],
      "id": "a5772d89-22af-4db4-b1b6-c92a317b6b59",
